    oe:aboutDisease oed:colorectal_cancer ;
    oe:answerText "The contribution of chemotherapy-induced tissue injury to individual susceptibility to metastasis remains largely unexplored. We report that chemotherapy indirectly prevents colorectal cancer (CRC) liver metastases by inducing a lasting systemic \"chemomemory\"."^^xsd:string ;
